# Orbit reads its published elements and world live (World.md W73; Admin.md §0.6): the same Supabase project as the
# admin and the studios (`@no-origins/auth`). Copy to .env.local. With neither set, every page draws the published copy
# in code (src/world/published.json) and nothing saves; with them, a visitor sees what is published and an account
# signed in through the shared login saves and publishes by its permissions. Production carries them on Vercel.
#
# Local stack: `npx supabase start`, then `npx supabase status` prints both.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
